  "description": "According to the morning's fortune, Park Mu-Woon was destined for a fated encounter. Instead, the universe delivers Na Yeon-Taek, the childhood tormentor he spent nine years trying to forget. What was supposed to be a \"lucky\" day quickly turns into a nightmare as the architect of Mu-Woon's past misery resurfaces. Now, forced back into each other's lives, Mu-Woon must confront a complicated history and the lingering shadows of a man he never wanted to see again.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
